 "name_en": "Group Reporting – Environmental, Social, and Governance Data (4R7)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Group Reporting – Environmental, Social, and Governance Data (4R7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The purpose of this scope item is to increase efficiency in building your own Environmental, Social, Corporate governance (ESG) data collection forms by the sample forms as reference.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The inclusion of ESG metrics helps companies to manage long-term company performance and provide transparency to stakeholders on the connectivity between ESG and financial KPIs.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Energy Consumption Form</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Water Consumption and withdrawal</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Personnel diversity and Inclusion</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">R&amp;D Projects Description</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Anti-Corruption Training</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Personnel discrimination cases</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support reporting regulatory compliant ESG metrics with the largest ESG ecosystem</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Act by planning your future with actionable insights, forecasts, and setting targets</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集团报表 - 环境、社会和治理数据 (4R7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目旨在通过示例表单作为参考来提高构建您自己的环境、社会、公司治理 (ESG) 数据收集表单的效率。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">纳入 ESG 指标有助于公司管理长期公司绩效，并为利益相关方提供 ESG 与财务 KPI 之间连接的透明度。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">能源消耗表单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">耗水量和取水量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">人员多样性和包容性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">研发项目描述</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">反腐败培训</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">人员歧视案件</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio60cec48974ac45c48827633a2d517c2c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">利用最大的 ESG 生态系统，报告符合法规的 ESG 指标</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用可据以采取行动的洞察、预测和设定目标，制定未来计划，从而采取行动</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
